## 16.14 What is still required for a complete deployment?

| Concern | Status in this lab |
|--------|--------|
| Typed input and output contracts | Demonstrated |
| Configuration validation | Demonstrated |
| Custom errors | Demonstrated |
| Logging | Demonstrated |
| Retry and cancellation | Demonstrated |
| Dependency injection | Demonstrated |
| Unit testing and mocks | Demonstrated |
| Actual provider SDK integration | Requires implementation |
| HTTP controller and authentication middleware | Requires implementation |
| Distributed rate limits and budgets | Requires implementation |
| Production circuit breaker | Requires implementation |
| Semantic model evaluation | Covered in a later module |
| Real deployment and load testing | Requires an environment |

The lab is an instructional service architecture rather than a fully deployed production application. The sample code has not been compiled or executed against a live TypeScript installation in this response.
